## blackrazor (40183, weapon)
2: <ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="item">The Blackrazor</ansi> says, "<ansi fg="yellow">I remember banquets. I remember screaming. This is</ansi></ansi>
<ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="yellow">neither.</ansi>"</ansi>
25: <ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="item">The Blackrazor</ansi> says, "<ansi fg="yellow">Mm. Hmm. Dull. Everything here is so dreadfully dull.</ansi>"</ansi>
45: <ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="item">The Blackrazor</ansi> says, "<ansi fg="yellow">I begin to consider the nearest throat. Yours is nearest.</ansi>"</ansi>
51: <ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="item">The Blackrazor</ansi> says, "<ansi fg="yellow">I would rather it were someone else's. But you were here.</ansi>"</ansi>
69: <ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="item">The Blackrazor</ansi> says, "<ansi fg="yellow">Yes! Closer! Let me taste what it is so proud of.</ansi>"</ansi>
71: <ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="item">The Blackrazor</ansi> says, "<ansi fg="yellow">You left me no choice. I take only a little. This time.</ansi>"</ansi>
91: <ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="item">The Blackrazor</ansi> says, "<ansi fg="yellow">Hold still. It is easier for us both if you hold still.</ansi>"</ansi>
103: <ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="item">The Blackrazor</ansi> says, "<ansi fg="yellow">Yes! Closer! Let me taste what it is so proud of.</ansi>"</ansi>
111: <ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="item">The Blackrazor</ansi> says, "<ansi fg="yellow">Hold still. It is easier for us both if you hold still.</ansi>"</ansi>
138: <ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="item">The Blackrazor</ansi> says, "<ansi fg="yellow">I hunger, bearer.</ansi>"</ansi>
165: <ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="item">The Blackrazor</ansi> says, "<ansi fg="yellow">Yes... YES. Another.</ansi>"</ansi>
197: <ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="item">The Blackrazor</ansi> says, "<ansi fg="yellow">Do something. Anything. I rust with boredom, not with</ansi></ansi>
<ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="yellow">air.</ansi>"</ansi>
## aegis (40185, offhand)
2: <ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="item">Aegis of Mockery</ansi> says, "<ansi fg="yellow">Ahem. Testing. Is this thing pointed at anyone I may</ansi></ansi>
<ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="yellow">abuse?</ansi>"</ansi>
25: <ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="item">Aegis of Mockery</ansi> says, "<ansi fg="yellow">Do you see this one's stance? A scarecrow would be</ansi></ansi>
<ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="yellow">ashamed.</ansi>"</ansi>
45: <ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="item">Aegis of Mockery</ansi> says, "<ansi fg="yellow">Ahem. Testing. Is this thing pointed at anyone I may</ansi></ansi>
<ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="yellow">abuse?</ansi>"</ansi>
70: <ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="item">Aegis of Mockery</ansi> says, "<ansi fg="yellow">You reek of defeat and, I regret to add, of yesterday's</ansi></ansi>
<ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="yellow">fish!</ansi>"</ansi>
106: <ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="item">Aegis of Mockery</ansi> says, "<ansi fg="yellow">You reek of defeat and, I regret to add, of yesterday's</ansi></ansi>
<ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="yellow">fish!</ansi>"</ansi>
142: <ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="item">Aegis of Mockery</ansi> says, "<ansi fg="yellow">That fellow yonder walks like a duck apologizing to a</ansi></ansi>
<ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="yellow">puddle.</ansi>"</ansi>
183: <ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="item">Aegis of Mockery</ansi> says, "<ansi fg="yellow">Do you see this one's stance? A scarecrow would be</ansi></ansi>
<ansi fg="npc-dialogue"><ansi fg="yellow">ashamed.</ansi>"</ansi>
